OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled after Piccadilly
OL,4,Asignalling fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services to, from and through
OL,7,FManchester Piccadilly have been
OL,8,Fcancelled or changed after a signalling
OL,9,Ffault disrupted the station.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail said a cabling issue meant
OL,12,Ftrains could not use platform 8 and
OL,13,Fengineers were working to fix the
OL,14,Fproblem.
OL,16,FNational Rail said the incident was
OL,17,Freported at 06:06 BST and disruption
OL,18,Fwas expected until 10:00.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
